# Deliberately almost empty, and it has to exist.
#
# The Vercel CLI falls back to .gitignore when there is no .vercelignore, and
# the .gitignore in this folder is `*` — it keeps the build artifacts out of the
# repository. Without this file the CLI would apply that rule to the upload and
# publish a site containing nothing but vercel.json, with no error.
#
# Everything in this folder is the build and belongs in the deployment.
.vercel
